WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.584
Which paid orders are still waiting to ship?

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:08.235
Late Order Monitor puts your oldest unfulfilled orders first.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.894
Narrow the list to orders waiting a week or more.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.396
When a customer asks, find their order by name.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.701
Export the filtered list and hand it to your fulfillment team.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.599
Find Late Order Monitor in the Wix App Market.
